{
  "_note": [
    "ที่หมายตา — the landmarks every bearing on the site is measured from. Nan 2026-09-06:",
    "'Orientation in comparison to other objects is this site's actual secret sauce. That and romanization.'",
    "A landmark is a RECORD, never a typed coordinate: `id` names a canonical record (its pin is",
    "read at build time), `osm` names an element in cache/osm-worship/ for a temple the catalogue",
    "does not yet hold as a pinned record (pins note 2026-09-05, fork F7). Fix a wrong pin in the",
    "catalogue, not here. `aliases` are the spellings an ADDRESS uses for it — the address parser",
    "matches these, longest first, Thai as a substring and Latin on word boundaries. `roman` is the",
    "RTGS reading written by hand (translit.py gives 'Pratuthaphae' for ประตูท่าแพ; a reading a",
    "reader can say beats one a rule produced). `reach_m` is how far away a place may be and still",
    "be told in terms of this landmark; `at_m` is how close it has to be to be 'at' it (0 = never",
    "'at': a university is a square kilometre and nothing is 'at' its centroid). `origin: true`",
    "marks the one point a province is measured from — Tha Phae Gate ('my house is 5 km due east",
    "of Tha Phae gate'), the clock tower in Chiang Rai (WO-27 already measures from it).",
    "Kinds: gate corner market mall hospital university airport temple monument park bridge",
    "terminal craft-village waterfall. Chains (Big C, Lotus, Makro) are deliberately absent — a",
    "branch name is not a bearing. NOT ON THIS DISK (no pinned record, no cache element; add",
    "when one exists): Chiang Mai railway station, Chang Phueak bus terminal, Chiang Mai Zoo,",
    "Kad Suan Kaew, Promenada, Ton Payom market, Somphet market, JJ market, Nawarat bridge,",
    "Rincome junction, Bangkok Hospital CM, Wat Rong Khun, Wat Huay Pla Kang, Chiang Rai bus",
    "terminal 1, Mae Fah Luang University, the Kok and Ping rivers (lines, not points — fork)."
  ],
